# This file contains descriptions of RASDAEMON_FEATURES USE_EXPAND flags.
# Keep it sorted.

abrt-report - Send events to the ABRT problem-reporting daemon
aer - Record PCIe Advanced Error Reporting (AER) events
bmc-generic - Report PCIe AER events as standard IPMI SEL records to the BMC (experimental)
cxl - Record Compute Express Link (CXL) device events
devlink - Record devlink health reports and network transmit timeouts
diskerror - Record block device I/O errors
erst - Read x86 machine checks the firmware saved through ACPI ERST in pstore
extlog - Record ACPI Extended Error Log (Intel eMCA) memory events
mce - Record and decode x86 Machine Check Exceptions
memory-ce-pfa - Account and offline memory pages with repeated corrected errors
memory-failure - Record the kernel memory failure (hwpoison) handling results
memory-row-ce-pfa - Account and offline DRAM rows with repeated corrected errors
pcie-edpc - Configure PCIe Enhanced Downstream Port Containment (eDPC) at startup
signal - Record SIGBUS signals sent for hardware memory errors (experimental)
